    "# Assignment 6 — Python\n",
    "## Topic: Square Root of a Complex Number\n",
    "\n",
    "**Task:** Find the square root of a real or complex number using Python's `cmath` module."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cafa6f79",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "import cmath\n",
    "\n",
    "num = 1 + 2j\n",
    "\n",
    "result = cmath.sqrt(num)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Square root of\", num, \"is\", result)\n"
   ]
  }
